[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-german-bundestag-scholarship-2027-for-africans-complete-application-guide-139":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},139,"german-bundestag-scholarship-2027-for-africans-complete-application-guide-139","German Bundestag Scholarship 2027 For Africans: Complete Application Guide","\u003Cp>The German Bundestag Scholarship is an IPS program for African countries (International Parliamentary Scholarship) by the German Government.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Participants in the German Bundestag Scholarship 2026 will be awarded a €700 grant and free accommodation in a residential complex. Travel costs will also be covered by the program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>German Bundestag Scholarship (International Parliamentary Scholarship) Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: German Parliament\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€700 Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: African Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>German Bundestag Scholarship 2027 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Participants will receive \u003Cstrong>a scholarship of €700\u003C\u002Fstrong> . The scholarship also includes free accommodation in a residential complex, travel expenses to and from Berlin, and health, accident, and liability insurance.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The core of the program is a one-week internship in the office of a member of the German Bundestag.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>There are a series of workshops on various topics, such as anti-corruption and intercultural training.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A project management workshop is designed to help participants develop their own project ideas to promote democracy and civil society in their respective countries of origin.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Requirements for German Bundestag Scholarship 2027 (IPS program for African Countries)\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the German Bundestag Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Nationality of one of the participating countries: Botswana, Ghana, Kenya, Namibia, Nigeria, Senegal, South Africa, Tanzania and Uganda\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>younger than 30 years  at the start of the scholarship or on 1 January\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>completed university studies\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Good knowledge of the German language  (at least level B2 of the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>strong interest in political issues and social\u002Fpolitical  engagement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Required Documents for the German Bundestag Scholarship 2027\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the German Bundestag Scholarship 2027, you must submit the following documents:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Recent language certificate\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Letter of motivation \u003C\u002Fstrong>(in German, max. two pages, signed by you personally)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Copy of passport or identity card\u003C\u002Fstrong> as proof of citizenship of a participant country\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University degree certificate\u003C\u002Fstrong> (in original or certified copy in English or German)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A \u003Cstrong>letter of recommendation\u003C\u002Fstrong> (in German or English) from a professor\u002Fteacher or employer, which assesses the applicant’s suitability for the IPS programme.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundestag.de\u002Fen\u002Feurope\u002Finternational\u002Fexchange\u002Fips\u002Fafrica-651046\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundestag.de\u002Fen\u002Feurope\u002Finternational\u002Fexchange\u002Fips\u002Fafrica-651046\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cbr \u002F>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-14 15:40:56",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fgerman-bundestag-scholarship-2027-for-africans-complete-application-guide\u002F69de51f8a3d1b0.76491620_screenshot 2026-04-14 153539.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fgerman-bundestag-scholarship-2027-for-africans-complete-application-guide\u002F69de51f8a3d1b0.76491620_screenshot%202026-04-14%20153539.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":9},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":19,"url":45},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot%202026-06-24%20201924.png","2026-06-24 20:40:26",{"id":48,"slug":49,"title":50,"images":51,"datePosted":55,"authorName":56},303,"chevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity","Chevening Scholarship 2027 Award In Uk: Fully Funded Opportunity",[52],{"fileName":53,"oldFileName":53,"type":18,"file":